---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /resume/
title: Résumé
shortTitle: Résumé
description: Résumé for Libin Samkutty, Senior QA Automation Engineer, building AI evaluation systems and test infrastructure for a production digital health platform.
lede: Everything here renders from the same data as the rest of the site, so this page cannot fall out of step with it. Ctrl+P prints cleanly.
bodyClass: resume
---
<div class="resume">
    <section class="resume__section" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
        <h2 id="summary-title">Summary</h2>
        <p>
            Senior QA Automation Engineer with {% metric "experience_years" %} building quality
            systems for production AI. Sole QA on a digital health platform serving
            {% metric "monthly_users" %} across {% metric "countries" %} countries and three
            distinct generation architectures. I design golden datasets and LLM judges, run
            production evaluation on live traffic, and own the test infrastructure underneath:
            {% metric "playwright_scenarios" %} end-to-end scenarios,
            {% metric "api_endpoints" %} API endpoints, and consumer-driven contracts between them.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="resume__section" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
        <h2 id="experience-title">Experience</h2>

        {% for role in timeline.roles %}
        <article class="resume__role">
            <h3>{{ role.title }}</h3>
            <p class="resume__meta">
                {{ role.employer }} · client {{ site.client.name }} · {{ role.location }} ·
                <time datetime="{{ role.start | isoDate }}">{{ role.start | monthYear }}</time>
                –
                {% if role.end %}<time datetime="{{ role.end | isoDate }}">{{ role.end | monthYear }}</time>{% else %}present{% endif %}
            </p>
            <p>{{ role.summary }}</p>
            {% if role.highlights %}
            <ul>
                {% for highlight in role.highlights %}<li>{{ highlight }}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ul>
            {% endif %}
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>

    <section class="resume__section" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
        <h2 id="capabilities-title">Core capabilities</h2>
        {% for group in skills.groups %}
            {% set core = group.skills | byLevel("core") %}
            {% if core.length %}
            <p>
                <strong>{{ group.name }}:</strong>
                {% for skill in core %}{{ skill.name }}{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}
            </p>
            {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        <p><a href="{{ '/skills/' | url }}">The full capability matrix, with definitions and evidence</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="resume__section" aria-labelledby="selected-title">
        <h2 id="selected-title">Selected work</h2>
        <ul>
            {% for item in collections.caseStudies %}
            <li><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a> · {{ item.data.scope }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="resume__section" aria-labelledby="oss-resume-title">
        <h2 id="oss-resume-title">Open source</h2>
        {% for project in skills.openSource %}
        <p><a href="{{ project.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ project.name }}</a> · {{ project.description }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>

    <section class="resume__section" aria-labelledby="education-title">
        <h2 id="education-title">Education</h2>
        {% for item in timeline.education %}
        <p>
            <strong>{{ item.qualification }}</strong> · {{ item.institution }} ·
            {{ item.end | year }} · {{ item.result }}
        </p>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>

    <section class="resume__section" aria-labelledby="contact-resume-title">
        <h2 id="contact-resume-title">Contact</h2>
        <ul class="contact-list">
            <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ site.profiles.linkedin }}" rel="me noopener">{{ site.profiles.linkedin }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ site.profiles.github }}" rel="me noopener">{{ site.profiles.github }}</a></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>
